time to relief</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The chapter is over</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You have to move on</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And find someone better than me, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Jannet, don't you worry about me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Forget all the memories</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You have to move on</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And find someone better than me, oh</p></div></body></tt>